        -- we had data to were cob_deducted on claim_procedure benefit had a dollar amount but there 
        -- was not a line for the claim procedure in claim_procedure_medicare.  I think the logic needs to be
        -- there has to be a medicare line to make it medicare 
        -- commented out 09/03/2021 they want to do more testing and we are going live with the changes for Flagler put back in 09/08/2021
        -- all of  bcbs, so flagler and nextera will process the same way if there was coinsurance. 
        -- so instead of checkbook id use community id
        IF @check_run_community_id IN ( 50, 55 ) -- nextera or bcbs was if @checkbook_id = 1300	elva 12/14/2021
